{% extends 'policy.njk' %}
{% block policy_body %}
<h2>1. Order Cancellation</h2>
<p><strong>Before Shipment:</strong> You may cancel your order for a full refund if it has not yet been shipped. Contact our atelier at <a href="tel:+919203326281">+91 92033 26281</a> with your order or enquiry reference number.</p>
<p><strong>After Shipment:</strong> Orders cannot be cancelled once shipped.</p>

<h2>2. Refund Policy</h2>
<h3>Eligibility for Refund</h3>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Cancelled Orders:</strong> Full refund applies if cancelled before shipment.</li>
  <li><strong>Returned Products:</strong> Refunds are only applicable if the product is returned in an unused, unopened, and original sealed packaging condition.</li>
  <li><strong>Failed Transactions:</strong> Automatic refunds are initiated if payment is debited but order placement fails.</li>
</ul>
<h3>Refund Method &amp; Timeframe</h3>
<ul>
  <li>Refunds process to the original payment method (UPI, Credit/Debit Card, Net Banking, Wallet).</li>
  <li>Refunds will be initiated within <strong>1–3 business days</strong> after the returned product passes quality inspection.</li>
  <li>Bank credit takes <strong>5–7 business days</strong> to appear.</li>
  <li>Failed transaction refunds typically reflect within <strong>3–7 business days</strong>.</li>
</ul>

<h2>3. Refund and Replacement Policy</h2>
<p>You can request a replacement within <strong>15 days of product delivery</strong>. Returns process within 2–4 days. Refunds credit within 7–10 working days.</p>

<h2>4. Exchange</h2>
<p>Product must return in original condition with all tags, packaging, and accessories. Replacement or exchanges will be delivered within 7–10 working days.</p>

<h2>Contact</h2>
<p>For any return / refund queries write to <a href="mailto:enquiries@xeviadiamonds.com">enquiries@xeviadiamonds.com</a> or call <a href="tel:+919203326281">+91 92033 26281</a>.</p>
{% endblock %}
